## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Equipment Changer|r 0.3.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Saves your worn gear, the skills on both action bars and the slotted champion skills under a name, and puts them back from the settings panel or from an extra page of the D-pad up wheel.
